---
title: Garlic-Confit Green Beans
servings: 4
tags: CSO, AI
source.author: AI Cooking Agent
course: Side dish
prep time: 5 minutes
cook time: 15 minutes
difficulty: Easy
---

Place a wire rack in the second lowest position of the #convection steam oven{}.
Preheat in convection steam mode at 325°F.

Clean and snap @green beans{1%lb}.
Place the beans in a large bowl with @garlic cloves{4}(smashed).
Add @olive oil{1/4%cup} and @salt{1%tsp} over the beans and garlic, toss to coat.

Cover a baking sheet with foil.
Transfer the beans mixture to the baking sheet and spread evenly.

Cook for ~{10-15%min} until the beans are tender and maybe slightly browned.

Transfer to a bowl for serving.
